Revision history for MooseX-RequiresClass

0.05      2026-09-01
          - Initial release.
          - requires_class sugar: a role can require that its consumer
            inherits from one or more given base classes.
          - Enforcement at role composition (compile-time). Covers single
            consumption (with 'Role'), combined (with 'A','B'), nested
            (role-in-role), and runtime role application to a class or object.
          - Per-class opt-out via:  with 'Role' => { -no_baseclass_checks => 1 }
